  "title": "The AI Lead Show with Dr Brian Lambert",
  "content": "<h2>Livestream Watch page</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Welcome to the live stream watch page.</p><p>Be sure to join the Brian Lambert show weekly at noon eastern (5 pm UTC).</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>watch The broadcast!</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<iframe src=\"https://player.restream.io/?token=91071b89fc4540efa94f5ab761d5f824\" allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen frameborder=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\"></iframe>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Previous shows</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t[automatic_youtube_gallery playlist=\"PLl_Ged-mdZZVFHsMmmd0pDAq_tggBk7EF\"]\n<p><strong>Sharing is caring! </strong> Please share our stream now:</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30.214 12.67 47.431 13.319-28.264-18.843-46.781-51.005-46.781-87.391 0-19.492 5.197-37.36 14.294-52.954 51.655 63.675 129.3 105.258 216.365 109.807-1.624-7.797-2.599-15.918-2.599-24.04 0-57.828 46.782-104.934 104.934-104.934 30.213 0 57.502 12.67 76.67 33.137 23.715-4.548 46.456-13.32 66.599-25.34-7.798 24.366-24.366 44.833-46.132 57.827 21.117-2.273 41.584-8.122 60.426-16.243-14.292 20.791-32.161 39.308-52.628 54.253z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLinkedIn\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M389.2 48h70.6L305.6 224.2 487 464H345L233.7 318.6 106.5 464H35.8L200.7 275.5 26.8 48H172.4L272.9 180.9 389.2 48zM364.4 421.8h39.1L151.1 88h-42L364.4 421.8z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tX\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Subscribe to be notified of future episodes!</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>About the show</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>The Brian Lambert Show is your go-to destination for mastering the digital economy.</p><p>Hosted by digital transformation expert Brian Lambert, this dynamic, interactive show blends expert insights, live problem-solving, and actionable strategies to help professionals and businesses thrive in today’s digital-first world. From breaking down complex tech topics to showcasing real-world solutions for modern challenges, the show empowers viewers with the skills and confidence needed to lead and succeed in the evolving digital landscape.</p><p>Tune in weekly to learn, engage, and future-proof your career—because mastering change starts here!</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Thank you to our show sponsors!</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.digitalcommand.co\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Digital-Command-Sq-qohvf0gsdja4ppk587di01aqolx1ubcsbl1mh84um8.png\" title=\"Digital Command Sq\" alt=\"Digital Command Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"298\" src=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Skillo_logo-1-1-1024x382.png\" alt=\"Skillo Digital Command\" srcset=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Skillo_logo-1-1-1024x382.png 1024w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Skillo_logo-1-1-300x112.png 300w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Skillo_logo-1-1-768x287.png 768w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Skillo_logo-1-1.png 1396w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"500\" height=\"265\" src=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Great-Benefits-Group-Logo-e1736541255646.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Great-Benefits-Group-Logo-e1736541255646.png 500w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Great-Benefits-Group-Logo-e1736541255646-300x159.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1-1024x684.png\" alt=\"The AI Lead by Dr Brian Lambert PHD\" srcset=\"https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1-1024x684.png 1024w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1-300x200.png 300w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1-768x513.png 768w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1-1536x1026.png 1536w, https://digitalcommand.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mockup-of-a-hard-cover-book-on-a-table-with-gadgets-3407-el1.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />",
